> mul1(x: u32, y: u32) = x*y
> mul2(x: u32, y: u32) = y*x
> equiv mul1 ~ mul2
mul1 and mul2 are equal on the domain of mul1 (proved by algebra: both sides expand to one polynomial in x, y mod 2^32)
